  "body_html": "<h1>doors_of_NCroom</h1>\n<h2>Lean type</h2>\n<p><code>lean\nlemma doors_of_NCroom [DecidableEq T] (h_room : isRoom σ C) (h_nc : isNearlyColorful c σ C) : ∃ door1 door2, door1 ≠ door2 ∧ NCdoors c σ C = {door1, door2}</code></p>\n<h2>Dependencies</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>isRoom</li>\n<li>isNearlyColorful</li>\n<li>NCdoors</li>\n<li>card_of_NCcell</li>\n<li>isCell</li>\n<li>IsPositiveAffineOf.symm</li>\n<li>Indifferent.symm</li>\n<li>Profile.ext</li>\n<li>image_erase_eq_erase_image_of_unique</li>\n<li>Dominant_of_subset</li>\n<li>isDominant</li>\n<li>Dominant_of_supset</li>\n<li>injOn_sdiff</li>\n<li>three_collision_card_bound</li>\n<li>collision_door_valid</li>\n<li>image_erase_collision_preserves</li>\n<li>Transitivity</li>\n</ul>",
